    system page. It is not part of the United States Code.</p></note>
    <note><heading>Amendment</heading><p><b>2026</b>—Subsec. (b)(1). Specimen Act of 2026
    amended paragraph (1) by striking <quotedContent>$5,000,000</quotedContent> and inserting
    the following:</p><quotedContent><p>$7,500,000 for each of fiscal years 2024 through 2030,
    of which not more than 5 percent may be used for administrative expenses.</p>
    </quotedContent></note>
  </notes>
