  <h2 class="toc-group" id="type">Type</h2>

  <p>
    Two faces, both served from this origin. Statutory text is set in <strong>Spectral</strong>;
    everything about the text — navigation, labels, notes, this sentence — is
    <strong>Archivo</strong>. Identifiers and guids are the system monospace stack. The files,
    their byte sizes and the commits they were built from are in
    <code>docs/verification/fonts.json</code>.
  </p>

  <div class="spec">
    <p class="spec__label">Spectral, the reading face</p>
    <p class="spec__spectral">
      There is authorized to be appropriated $7,500,000 for each of fiscal years 2024 through
      2030. <em>Emphasis</em> and <strong>weight</strong> are both reachable from the text of
      the Code itself, so all four serif files are declared.
    </p>
    <p class="spec__label">Archivo, the interface face</p>
    <p class="spec__archivo">
      Release point 119-102not101, current through 07/12/2026. <em>Emphasis</em> and
      <strong>weight</strong>, one variable file per style.
    </p>
    <p class="spec__label">The system monospace stack</p>
