        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>

  <table class="usa-table usa-table--borderless pairs" data-pairs>
    <caption>
      Declared colour pairs, with the contrast ratio computed in this theme. WCAG 2.1 AA asks
      4.5:1 of text and 3:1 of the parts of a control that identify it.
    </caption>
