    The same pairs are computed from <code>frontend/src/styles/site.scss</code> by
    <code>uv run python scripts/contrast.py</code>, which writes
    <code>docs/verification/contrast.json</code> and exits non-zero on a failure. The two
    answers are compared in the browser suite.
  </p>

