  {/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- status */}
  <h2 class="toc-group" id="status">Status badges</h2>

  <p>
    A repealed, omitted, transferred or reserved provision keeps its place in reading order and
    arrives badged. The status set is not closed — USLM 2.x adds <code>renumbered</code>, and
    the source may publish a value nothing here has seen. An unrecognised status keeps the plain
    pill and prints its own word, which is the part that carries the meaning; the colour and the
    border are emphasis, and the word survives a monochrome print without them.
  </p>

